# pyenv
#   For a library or package, you might want to ignore these files since the code is
#   intended to run in multiple environments; otherwise, check them in:
# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if delegates have different platforms or python versions,
#   this may cause dependency resolution issues.
# Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, poetry.lock contains specific versions of dependencies and should be
#   tracked unless there are specific reasons not to.
# poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, pdm.lock contains specific versions of dependencies and should be
#   tracked unless there are specific reasons not to.
# pdm.lock

